SUMMARY:Vaulted Treasures
DESCRIPTION:Vaulted Treasures offers a rare opportunity to rediscover the Guild’s historic collection through a selection of works that have never before been framed or have not been exhibited in recent years. Featuring landscapes\, still lifes\, and portraits by the Guild’s founders\, the exhibition reveals both familiar and lesser-seen treasures from the Guild’s artistic legacy. Several historic works are presented in new frames made possible through a grant from the Brown County Community Foundation\, offering these pieces a renewed presence for contemporary audiences.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/vaulted-treasures/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vault_treasure_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Brown County Art Guild
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
