CREATED:20261102T191753Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T191753Z
UID:33837-1794528000-1805068799@browncountyartguild.org
SUMMARY:Small Wonders
DESCRIPTION:Small Wonders celebrates the beauty and intimacy of original petite artworks. Featuring charming 6 x 6 paintings by Guild Artists\, this collection invites you to discover the delicate details\, quiet joy\, and sense of wonder found in small-scale art. Perfect for beginning or adding to a collection\, and especially lovely for gifting as the holiday season approaches\, these sweet little works are a wonderful reminder that sometimes the most extraordinary things come in small packages.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/small-wonders-2/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/small_wonders_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
