SUMMARY:Guild Artist Exhibition & Sale
DESCRIPTION:Explore an exceptional collection of new works from our talented guild artists\, showcasing an elegant variety of mediums\, styles\, and artistic perspectives. Each artist brings a distinctive vision and refined approach to their craft\, creating pieces that are as individual as they are captivating. Discover a work that speaks to you—and make it part of your collection.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/guild-artist-exhibition-sale-6/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/guild_artist_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
