UID:33833-1794528000-1805068799@browncountyartguild.org
SUMMARY:A Moment in Time
DESCRIPTION:A Moment in Time invites Guild Artists to capture a special moment—whether found in nature\, experienced in the studio\, remembered from the past\, or discovered in an unexpected moment of reflection. Each work explores the beauty of a fleeting instant: a particular time of day\, a treasured memory\, or the subtle change of light that transforms an ordinary scene. Through their art\, Guild Artists invite us to pause\, look closely\, and experience that moment through their eyes.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/a-moment-in-time/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/moment_time_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
